== Monero stagenet: the node (tools/regtest/stagenet-up.sh)
  monerod 0.18.5.1 (pinned sha256 9b3b2676...a1f5), run inside WSL:
    monerod --stagenet --prune-blockchain --sync-pruned-blocks --data-dir <repo>/.sim/stagenet/chain
      --rpc-bind-ip 127.0.0.1 --rpc-bind-port 38081 --p2p-bind-ip 127.0.0.1 --p2p-bind-port 38080 --in-peers 0
      --hide-my-port --no-igd --check-updates disabled --disable-dns-checkpoints --no-zmq --non-interactive
  (the first start, 08:40:58Z, ran without --check-updates disabled --disable-dns-checkpoints; it made one DNS TXT
  lookup for updates.moneropulse.org; restarted with both flags at 08:48Z, the sync resuming from the saved chain)
  get_info after start: nettype stagenet, mainnet false, stagenet true, incoming_connections_count 0.
  first peer (monerod.log): [37.187.74.171:48080 OUT] Sync data returned a new top block candidate: 1 -> 2205297

  sync samples (stagenet-up.sh progress; unix time, height, target, bytes on disk):
